This is a restricted license. It is not an open-source license and does not
grant a general right to redistribute, modify, or sublicense the Policy
Repository.

2. Permitted uses

Permission is granted to:

a. view and inspect the Policy Repository;

b. reference the Policy Repository by URL, Git tag, or commit hash;

c. clone or fetch an unmodified copy solely as technically required to inspect
   the policy or use the Policy Repository as a Git submodule;

d. include an unmodified Git submodule reference to the Policy Repository in
   another repository;

e. copy and adapt files stored under `templates/` into a consuming repository
   solely for the purpose of declaring that consuming repository's own
   licensing policy.

